          "Throughout, measure yourself by the team's progress: Sprint Goals met, actions completed, impediments resolved faster and a team that runs more of its events without you. Our guide to [Scrum metrics and KPIs](/project-management/scrum/scrum-metrics-and-kpis/) explains which measures help and why velocity should not be used as a target.",
